  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></math><br /><br />Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />This limit exists when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br /><br />So,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />It is given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> are&nbsp;the solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> are&nbsp;the roots of the quadratic equation.&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>Sum of roots</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br />Product of roots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>,&#160;</mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
